# This bundle carries its own ignore rules: it is copied around as a folder, so what must never be
# committed is declared next to the files it applies to. Paths are relative to this directory.

# Upstream binaries, 42 MB and 12 MB. Assemble them on the way in — see 01-setup.md
step
step-kms-plugin

# Ceremony output. The certificates go to the CA host, and the root reaches clients through Key Vault
# (#144); nothing the ceremony writes belongs in the repo.
*.crt
*.crt.*
*.csr
*.key
*.pem
*_key*
*.new
